      {
        "id": "s2_item",
        "visual": {
          "type": "news_item",
          "index": 2,
          "section": "今日要闻",
          "title": "Anthropic 自研版本控制系统 Scion：五个月替换 Git 应对 AI 代码洪流",
          "link": "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/redesigning-source-control",
          "tags": [],
          "source": "",
          "bullets": [
            "Anthropic 宣布自建版本控制系统 Scion，五个月内将整个 monorepo 从 Git 完全迁移，为 AI 生成代码规模重构基础设施。",
            "日均代码合并量从 5 月约 2,500 次涨到 9 月超 30,000 次（12 倍），为人类协作设计的 Git 成瓶颈；七人团队完成迁移，Git 镜像基础设施缩至原来的两百分之一，并配套推出代码评审工具 Antique。",
            "AI Coding 倒逼研发基建重构的首个完整案例，团队的版本管理与评审流程设计思路可直接借鉴。"
          ],
          "original_url": "https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/redesigning-source-control",
          "image_source": "pexels",
          "summary": "As our merges per day grew more than tenfold， source control became our biggest development bottleneck. Here， we share how we migrated to an in-house version control system in five months.",
          "images": [
            "images/8625f276e3_pexels.jpg"
          ],
          "image_sizes": [
            [
              1880,
              1253
            ]
          ]
        },
        "clauses": [
          "Anthropic 自研版本控制系统 Scion：五个月替换 Git 应对 AI 代码洪流。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "s3_item",
        "visual": {
          "type": "news_item",
          "index": 3,
          "section": "今日要闻",
          "title": "Google 用 Gemini 4 Argon 无人值守优化 20 万行 Python 代码库 ADK",
          "link": "https://developers.googleblog.com/optimizing-a-200000-line-python-codebase-overnight-with-gemini-4-argon/",
          "tags": [],
          "source": "",
          "bullets": [
            "Google 工程师让 Argon 在 google/adk-python 无人值守跑 11 小时，6 项优化提案经审查合并 2 项，长会话内存会话准备时间降约 40%，包导入加快 21%。",
            "仓库约 800 文件、20.5 万行、16,892 个测试；方法是把维护者指南放进 .agents/skills 目录加 Antigravity /goal 模式固定目标，158 轮运行从 65.6 秒缩到 56.1 秒；另 4 项提案因依赖弱引用、私有属性等被审查否决。",
            "完整的\"智能体探索、维护者做减法\"落地复盘，.agents/skills 规则文件布局可直接复制到自己仓库跑通宵优化。"
          ],
          "original_url": "https://developers.googleblog.com/optimizing-a-200000-line-python-codebase-overnight-with-gemini-4-argon/",
          "image_source": "original",
          "summary": "See the prompts， .agents、skills rulefiles， and code review decisions from the overnight Gemini 4 Argon run that made Google s Python Agent Development Kit ADK 40% faster in long sessions.",
          "images": [
            "images/ee6ad87839_1.jpg"
          ],
          "image_sizes": [
            [
              1200,
              600
            ]
          ]
        },
        "clauses": [
          "Google 用 Gemini 4 Argon 无人值守优化 20 万行 Python 代码库 ADK。"
        ]
      },
