          "title": "LangChain 发布 langchain-scaledown：约束解码模型压缩长时智能体上下文",
          "link": "https://www.langchain.com/blog/building-long-running-agents-with-scaledown-and-deep-agents",
          "tags": [],
          "source": "",
          "bullets": [
            "LangChain 发布 langchain-scaledown 集成，用 ScaleDown 约束解码模型（CDM）替代通用 LLM 做智能体上下文管理，官方报告比前沿模型快 200 倍、便宜 467 倍。",
            "提供 Summarize/Compress/Extract/Classify 四个 LangChain 与 Deep Agents 中间件，分别负责摘要旧历史、压缩工具结果、提取结构化字段、分类运行漂移断路；单模型支持 100 万 token 输入及图像、扫描 PDF；LangSmith LLM Gateway 同步接入，新账户送 5000 万免费 token。",
            "长时智能体每一轮的上下文决策不再烧前沿模型，成本与延迟优化方案开箱即用，Python 生态可直接 pip 接入。"
          ],
          "original_url": "https://www.langchain.com/blog/building-long-running-agents-with-scaledown-and-deep-agents",
          "image_source": "original",
          "summary": "Use ScaleDown s constrained decoding models with LangChain and Deep Agents to summarize history， compress tool results， and extract data faster and cheaper.",
          "images": [
            "images/d4dd8fdaf2_1.jpg"
          ],
